        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Matt Andersen"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;With Opening Act Old Man Luedecke! When Matt Andersen steps on stage, he brings a lifetime of music to every note he plays. His latest album, The Hammer &amp; The Rose, is a veritable garden of heart; a (mostly) delicate collection of tender folk and stirring soul numbers that find the New Brunswick-born songwriter thoughtfully...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
