    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Presented As part of the Northern Spark Emerging Artist Series A Collaboration Between NACC and The UNDerground Hughes is the folk‑alt‑country project of Yellowknife musician Benji Straker. Blending folk, alt‑country, and indie sensibilities, Hughes creates music that is honest, atmospheric, and deeply personal. The project draws inspiration from the stark beauty of the North and the...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
