    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A CELTIC TREAT Seán Dagher (cittern/bouzouki, banjo &amp; vocals)is the artistic director of La Nef and an active performer, arranger, and composer of music from various folk and classical music traditions. He won the OPUS “Creation of the Year” award in 2014 for Sea Songs and has been nominated for numerous Adisq awards. SEÁN DAGHER...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
