    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;GRAMMY-NOMINATED GUESTS FROM NORWAY ANNA MARIA FRIMAN / LINN ANDREA FUGLSETH / JORUNN LOVISE HUSAN The crystalline voices of Trio Mediaeval have captivated audiences since the group was founded in Oslo in 1997. The Grammy-nominated trio’s core repertoire features sacred monophonic and polyphonic medieval music from England, Italyand France; contemporary works written for the ensemble;...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
